No. B/U/C is the blessed/uncursed/cursed status of an object.

But you can consider it also a "luck status" since the stone
"works" differently if blessed, uncursed, or cursed. I suppose
it's clear that you should always keep it at least non-cursed
while you carry it in your open inventory.

 > b) how do I check MY luck status (is not shown onscreen)?

You cannot directly observe your luck, but there are magical
means ("enlightenment") to get some information about your
luck. Depending on what you do your luck may change and you
might get a message indicating some luck change. There's a
large spoiler; if you like to get much more information read
http://www.spod-central.org/~psmith/nh/gems-343.txt

